  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">모둠활동을 잘하는 2학년들의 특성을 살려  팀별로 수행과제를 선택하여 발표하도록 했습니다. 횡파와 종파를 담당한 모둠에서 용수철로 시연을 보이면서, 바닥에 색테이프를 붙여 매질의 진동방향과 파동의 진행방향을 설명하였습니다. 간단하면서 이해하기 쉬운 방법이라는 생각이 들었습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">과제선택, 준비, 발표 모두 한 차시 안에 이루어졌습니다. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">모두 참여하여 발표한 경우에만 만점을 받을 수 있다고 미리 안내하였습니다(1학년 때 부터 그렇게 해 왔기 때문에&nbsp;소외된&nbsp;친구들이 없는 팀워크가 형성된 것 같습니다.).</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">모둠별 탐구과제는 다음과 같습니다.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수행 과제</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">1&gt; </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">용수철로 횡파를 만들고, 횡파의 뜻을 설명하시오</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수행 과제</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">2&gt; </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">용수철로 종파를 만들고, 종파의 뜻을 설명하시오</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수행 과제 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">3&gt; (</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">횡파</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">파장</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">진폭</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">마루</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">골의 뜻을 설명하시오</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수행 과제 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">4&gt; (</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">종파</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">) </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">밀</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">소</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">파장의 뜻을 설명하시오</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수행 과제 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">5&gt; </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">주기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">진동수를 설명하시오</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.(</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그림으로 설명 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">+</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">숫자를 예를 들어 설명+</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">단위 설명 포함</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">) </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수행 과제 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">6&gt; </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교과서 문제 풀이 </span></p><p><br></p></span><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E86F425ACC1A7E10\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_99E86F425ACC1A7E10BF97\"/></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B4DA425ACC1A9305\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\"  id=\"A_99B4DA425ACC1A930593AA\"/></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
